#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:5 50d40d3c7b2742b5950994f669887529
msgid "Guided Mode"
msgstr "Guided 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:7 db87c460073b4e889575eee0b7c86792
msgid ""
"Guided mode is a capability of Copter to dynamically guide the copter to a "
"target location wirelessly using a telemetry radio module and ground station"
" application. This page provides instructions for using guided mode."
msgstr "Guided 模式使飞机能够通过数传电台模块和地面站应用，动态引导飞机前往目标位置。本页面提供 Guided 模式的使用说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:12 29baea3ff7c344fe85ea32ffcf9dbc96
msgid ""
"Guided Mode can also be used by LUA scripts and companion computers to "
"command vehicle movement and navigation."
msgstr "Guided 模式也可由 LUA 脚本和伴侣计算机用于控制飞行器移动和导航。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:15 fd50feaefb2149ca9cae878113459e76
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:17 b2dc66ac5b6a40eaa10109865945323f
msgid ""
"Guided mode is not a traditional flight mode that would be assigned to a "
"mode switch like other flight modes. The guided mode capability is enabled "
"using a ground station application (such as Mission Planner) and a "
":ref:`telemetry radio <common-telemetry-landingpage>`. This capability "
"allows the pilot to interactively command the copter to travel to a target "
"location by clicking on a point on the Mission Planner Flight Data map. Once"
" the location is reached, the copter will hover at that location, waiting "
"for the next target. Follow Me mode also uses Guided Mode to make the copter"
" follow the pilot around the field."
msgstr ""
"Guided 模式并非像其他飞行模式那样分配到模式切换开关的传统飞行模式。Guided 模式功能通过地面站应用（如 Mission Planner）和 "
":ref:`数传电台 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 启用。飞手可通过点击 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据地图上的某点，交互式地指令飞机飞往目标位置。到达位置后，飞机将在该位置悬停，等待下一个目标。跟随我模式也使用 Guided 模式使飞机跟随飞手。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:32 39dbec93c6c64381bf7ad9c317a2936c
msgid "What you'll need"
msgstr "所需设备"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:34 15aa37d3aa6b48599eaf186226b53776
msgid ""
"To use guided mode, you'll need a :ref:`telemetry radio <common-telemetry-"
"landingpage>` allowing your computer and autopilot to communicate during "
"flight, a ground station computer or tablet, and a ground station "
"application such as :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>`."
msgstr ""
"要使用 Guided 模式，您需要 :ref:`数传电台 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` "
"以在飞行中实现电脑与飞控通信，以及地面站电脑或平板，和地面站应用（如 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:40 aa0b11807e7e4e75a28a9f56ce9c2335
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "操作说明"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:42 e11eb50209b44b87b5a09027e9505d8a
msgid ""
"Set up your copter at the field and establish a MAVLink connection over "
"wireless telemetry between your copter and your laptop."
msgstr "在飞场设置好飞机，并通过无线数传在飞机与笔记本之间建立 MAVLink 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:44 e633a72f622e4314917a703c32e12fa3
msgid ""
"On your laptop, using the software that came with the telemetry module, make"
" sure that it's working and that you have a GPS lock."
msgstr "在笔记本上，使用数传模块自带软件确认其正常工作且已获得 GPS 锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:46 5f981f3671a94212a01037089c30802e
msgid ""
"Take off in :ref:`Loiter Mode <loiter-mode>` and climb to a safe altitude"
msgstr "在 :ref:`Loiter 模式 <loiter-mode>` 下起飞并爬升至安全高度"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:47 4dec95ee5af64ea29b45f7e4b248739b
msgid ""
"In the Mission Planner Flight Data screen map, try right-clicking on a "
"nearby spot and select \"Fly to Here\"."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的地图上，右键单击附近某处并选择\"Fly to Here\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:49 245024db1cb14138a2564eab74c5289d
msgid ""
"You will be asked for a guided mode altitude. Enter an above home altitude "
"in meters."
msgstr "系统将提示输入 Guided 模式高度，以米为单位输入相对起飞点的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:55 e64fce062a8540e49c56602dab290c30
msgid ""
"A \"Guided\" target should appear on the map and the orange line (which "
"indicates the target heading) should point to this guided target."
msgstr "地图上应出现\"Guided\"目标，橙色线（表示目标航向）应指向该引导目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:61 9c95e9cc021a44908d0186cfaab35748
msgid ""
"The vehicle should fly to the target location and wait there until you enter"
" another location or switch to another mode."
msgstr "飞行器应飞往目标位置并在那里等待，直到您输入下一个位置或切换到其他模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:66 5773b6e1d3b94dbbb9c6d1c716c6679c
msgid ""
"On *Mission Planner* there is no need to set up one of your flight modes as "
"\"Guided\". This may not be the case for other Ground Control Stations."
msgstr "在 *Mission Planner* 中无需将某个飞行模式设置为\"Guided\"。其他地面站软件可能有所不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:71 be1461dec3344606b30ba6285835c7b6
msgid "Speed Control"
msgstr "速度控制"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:73 f843229aab24402394d1ef21a7e72f8a
msgid ""
"The maximum horizontal speed of the copter can be adjusted with the "
"**Speed** (:ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>`) parameter from the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Copter Pids screen (see blue box above).  The default is 10"
" meaning 10m/s.  A typical copter can reach top speeds of 10m/s ~ 13m/s "
"before it becomes unable to both maintain altitude and horizontal speed."
msgstr ""
"飞行器的最大水平速度可通过 Mission Planner 配置/调参 >> Copter Pids 界面中的 **Speed** "
"（:ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>`）参数调整（见上方蓝框）。默认值为 10，即 "
"10m/s。一般的飞行器在无法同时维持高度和水平速度之前，最高可达 10m/s ~ 13m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:80 175f6afb06904437b9c5934da28e7dca
msgid ""
"The vertical speeds up and down can similar be adjusted with the **Speed "
"Up** (:ref:`WP_SPD_UP<WP_SPD_UP>`) and **Speed Dn** "
"(:ref:`WP_SPD_DN<WP_SPD_DN>`) parameters. :ref:`WP_ACC_Z<WP_ACC_Z>` "
"determines how fast the speed can change."
msgstr ""
"上升和下降的垂直速度同样可通过 **Speed Up** （:ref:`WP_SPD_UP<WP_SPD_UP>`）和 **Speed Dn** "
"（:ref:`WP_SPD_DN<WP_SPD_DN>`）参数调整。:ref:`WP_ACC_Z<WP_ACC_Z>` 决定速度变化的快慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:82 f2de52fa32d54cc691255e47239b3c61
msgid ""
"Speed can also be controlled while in GUIDED mode with :ref:`MAVLink "
"commands <common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` like "
":ref:`DO_CHANGE_SPEED<mav_cmd_do_change_speed>`."
msgstr ""
"在 GUIDED 模式下，速度也可通过 :ref:`MAVLink 命令 <common-mavlink-mission-command-"
"messages-mav_cmd>` （如 :ref:`DO_CHANGE_SPEED<mav_cmd_do_change_speed>`）进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:85 e91eca09f97e4ae3854da6f7b11768fa
msgid "Guided Mode Options"
msgstr "Guided 模式选项"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:87 7e1707d0b64f4448ad7df1a066a19d23
msgid ""
"The :ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` parameter allows several guided mode "
"behavior changes:"
msgstr ":ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` 参数允许对 Guided 模式行为进行以下调整："

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:90 31c106b3c7c24252ad78fec61fa6b73f
msgid "Bit"
msgstr "位"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:90 ae34f052776741bf9447b697bfa3419e
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:92 1e52b4237a2d484ea470dc1258008a5f
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:92 fee2a2f16a73454a9461b337761f8a4d
msgid "Allow Arming from Transmitter"
msgstr "允许从遥控器解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:93 7b2ad24b86134a9fb9671323c8bd5dd7
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:93 f7e6ab78ecf04822a39f16fc87fb5573
msgid "Ignore pilot yaw input"
msgstr "忽略飞手偏航输入"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:94 3e552f656a844bafba5d678ac524e306
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:94 32fe8f18b7a64b9d9cadb2fd527c759b
msgid "SetAttitudeTarget interprets Thrust As Thrust"
msgstr "SetAttitudeTarget 将推力解释为推力值"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:95 68f77ceea9974a00b74dea72ecc16c88
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:95 d17c9c69bab644baadf6ec47e43646e0
msgid "Do not stabilize PositionXY"
msgstr "不稳定化 PositionXY"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:96 88bfc182b1c84ada8578d6a5a045fe1c
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:96 ba8bce8e12264b059f07813afd4986c2
msgid "Do not stabilize VelocityXY"
msgstr "不稳定化 VelocityXY"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:97 a431cc2f8bc843df887fd0e83e643463
msgid "6"
msgstr "6"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:97 3e4ac281b18c4524afb6e44806ee51df
msgid "Waypoint navigation used for position targets"
msgstr "使用航点导航到达位置目标"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:98 a564d9a1e69148ff97b3ef7460d970c7
msgid "7"
msgstr "7"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:98 7652c04e09e6492db258a2db70404e12
msgid "Allow weathervaning"
msgstr "允许风向标效应"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:101 263cf65555214183bcf8ee6e58216ea1
msgid "Bit 0 (e.g. \"1\") allowing arming in Guided mode from the RC transmitter"
msgstr "位 0（如\"1\"）允许在 Guided 模式下通过 RC 遥控器解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:103 806f2ad2607442d7a26d4bc6463db4f2
msgid ""
"Bit 2 (e.g. \"4\") disables the pilot's ability to change the vehicle's "
"heading using the RC transmitter"
msgstr "位 2（如\"4\"）禁止飞手使用 RC 遥控器改变飞行器航向"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:105 b66dae37515a459fabb863cafb873bd3
msgid ""
"Bit 3 (e.g. \"8\") changes the interpretation of the `SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET "
"MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__ "
"command's ``thrust`` field to be pure thrust expressed as a value between 0 "
"and 1, instead of a climb rate. See :ref:`Copter Commands in Guided Mode "
"<copter-commands-in-guided-mode>` for more details"
msgstr ""
"位 3（如\"8\"）将 `SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET MAVLink "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__ 命令的 "
"``thrust`` 字段解释更改为 0 到 1 之间的纯推力值，而非爬升速率。详见 :ref:`Copter Commands in Guided "
"Mode <copter-commands-in-guided-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:107 e76e2da60d504992ac3ed7882830199e
msgid ""
"Bit 4 (e.g. \"16\") disables the position controller's XY axis position "
"error correction.  This may be useful if an external controller is providing"
" high speed targets which already include position error correction"
msgstr "位 4（如\"16\"）禁用位置控制器的 XY 轴位置误差修正。若外部控制器已提供含位置误差修正的高速目标，此选项可能有用"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:109 1abd004b41d94b5ea6810d8d978e04eb
msgid ""
"Bit 5 (e.g. \"32\") is the same as above but affects the position "
"controller's velocity error correction"
msgstr "位 5（如\"32\"）与上述相同，但影响位置控制器的速度误差修正"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:111 cbaabe72b18b4cb3b7be7a7f58276f64
msgid ""
"Bit 6 (e.g. \"64\") enables S-Curve path planning (the same as is used in "
":ref:`Auto mode <auto-mode>`) to reach the position target.  This may result"
" a smoother acceleration and deceleration but the position target cannot be "
"updated quickly.  This also allows :ref:`object avoidance path planning "
"<common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` (e.g. :ref:`Bendy Ruler <common-oa-"
"bendyruler>` and :ref:`Dijkstras<common-oa-dijkstras>`) to be used in Guided"
" mode"
msgstr ""
"位 6（如\"64\"）启用 S 曲线路径规划（与 :ref:`Auto 模式 <auto-mode>` "
"相同）以到达位置目标。这可能带来更平滑的加减速，但位置目标更新不能太频繁。此选项也允许在 Guided 模式中使用 :ref:`避障路径规划 "
"<common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` （如 :ref:`Bendy Ruler <common-oa-"
"bendyruler>` 和 :ref:`Dijkstras<common-oa-dijkstras>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:113 41ba0223c65248e081af91be007af3b4
msgid "Bit 7 (e.g. \"128\") enables :ref:`weathervaning <weathervaning>`"
msgstr "位 7（如\"128\"）启用 :ref:`风向标效应 <weathervaning>`"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:115 d1f251df303f4ed798d3f93f290661ab
msgid ""
"The :ref:`GUID_TIMEOUT<GUID_TIMEOUT>` parameter holds the timeout (in "
"seconds) when the vehicle is being controlled using attitude, velocity "
"and/or acceleration commands. If no commands are received from the companion"
" computer for this many seconds, the vehicle will slow to a stop (if "
"velocity and/or acceleration commands were being provided) or hold a level "
"hover (if attitude commands were provided). The default setting is 3 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GUID_TIMEOUT<GUID_TIMEOUT>` "
"参数设定飞行器在通过姿态、速度和/或加速度命令控制时的超时时间（秒）。若在此时间内伴侣计算机未发送命令，飞行器将减速至停止（若提供的是速度/加速度命令）或保持水平悬停（若提供的是姿态命令）。默认值为"
" 3 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:120 10151299c8854fa1bd2dbb9ca5bf815d
msgid "Guided_NoGPS"
msgstr "Guided_NoGPS"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:121 f7194ec6a3054dd6abb71ee9ae3c8841
msgid ""
"This variation of Guided mode does not require a GPS but it only accepts "
"`attitude targets "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__.  "
"Because it does not accept position or velocity targets like regular Guided "
"mode it is generally not useful for regular users.  This mode was created "
"for use by companion computers that may want to fly the vehicle as if it was"
" in AltHold mode."
msgstr ""
"此 Guided 模式变体无需 GPS，但只接受 `姿态目标 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__。由于它不像常规 "
"Guided 模式那样接受位置或速度目标，对普通用户通常无实用价值。此模式专为希望以 AltHold 模式飞行的伴侣计算机而设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_guidedmode.rst:125 d1f3b141905f4e34ac4ff437822cf1fd
msgid ""
"Guided_NoGPS does not allow a vehicle to hold position without a GPS (i.e. "
"non-GPS navigation).  For information on :ref:`non-GPS navigation see this "
"wiki page <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>`"
msgstr ""
"Guided_NoGPS 不允许飞行器在无 GPS 的情况下保持位置（即非 GPS 导航）。有关 :ref:`非 GPS 导航，请参阅此 Wiki 页面"
" <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>`"
